name: Read retained scope spending without approving more work
size: 120x36
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_allowance_reader.py @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 Shared allowance: calls 3/3 | budget-overview
expect: 0 calls left
expect: 0 unsettled
expect: cost not recorded
expect-not: ACCEPTED SCOPES
expect-not: session:$0
ask: Does scope review show the shared investigation's three spent calls, exhausted allowance and unavailable dollar charges without treating them as this proposal's individual cost or approving future work?
keys: Tab Home
require-live-snap: 20 Shared allowance: calls 3/3 | budget-detail-120x36
resize: 160x48
live-snap: budget-detail-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: budget-detail-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: budget-detail-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: budget-detail-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: budget-detail-40x12
expect: calls 3/3
expect: 0 calls left
expect: 0 unsettled
expect: cost not
expect: recorded
ask: At the compact size, are spending, protected Review capacity, unknown charges and reading controls understandable without covering the selected scope or inventing zero consumption?
resize: 120x36
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Shared investigation: monorepo-scope-quality-20261025 r3 | budget-tail
expect: 0 other calls left
expect: Dollar ceiling: not enforced
expect: Totals cover all work sharing this investigation
keys: Escape Escape C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 Shared allowance: calls 3/3 | budget-restarted
expect: 0 calls left
expect: cost not recorded
expect-not: ACCEPTED SCOPES
expect-not: session:$0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_allowance_reader.py @ART inspected
ask: After no-color restart, does the same draft retain its shared spending and leave acceptance, context activation, jobs and further allowance as separate operator decisions?
keys: Escape C-c
require-exit: 10
